      "To answer the query, I first searched for the prescribed script (`run-on-your-own-data.py`) and any code for \"data-label alignment\" or \"ddc\" in the `data-label-alignment` repository, but none was found. I located the MRPC entailment dataset as CSV files in `/workspace/entailment-data/mrpc_csv` and reviewed their structure. As the repository didn't provide a script to compute bag-of-words data-label alignment, I wrote a custom Python script that:\n",
